      381.0,
      288.84,
      651.68
    ],
    "text": "Ref No.: MLB/LND/LNDAQ/L1/50 Land Ministry No.: 4-3/6/2017/HW/220. IT is hereby give notice under sub section (1) of Section 7 of Land Acquisition Act as amended by the Land Acquisition amendment Act No. 28 of 1964 that the government intended to acquire the following land or servitude which is required for public purpose:- Description of the land to be acquired : Below mentioned land depicted as lot No. 1 and 2 in plan No. P.P./MR/2744 situated in the village of Malimbada in Malimbada Divisional Secretariat Division in Matara District and in Southern Province was acquired for the re-establishment of the Southern Expressway Project (Southern part extension). 01. Lot No. 01 Name of the Land: Nugadugodawaththa, Nugadugoda alias Nugaduwa; Description of the Land : Home graden, having multi crop plantation; Initial Claimant of the Land: Government; Extent : 0.6805 Hectare.",
