      403.52,
      539.64,
      540.32
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/ lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat Malimbada on the 10th day of December 2018 at 10.30 am and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 03rd day of December 2018 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of there claim for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
